  "notes": "Seven-section bidirectional metre-gauge Tramlink for BLT (10 units, delivery 2022). Capacity 265 at 4 persons/m² with 88 seats (+16 folding seats not counted). Five double and two single doors per side (7). Power 6 × 100 kW. Entrance height 400 mm. The data sheet prints the supply voltage as 1,500 V DC; this was not cross-checked, so supplySystems is left empty. Uses real-axle bogies; the number of suspended modules is not stated.",
